/**
 * LINE Let's Get Rich (Peak Era Recreation) — 16:9 UI & Interactive Modals Manager
 * Faithful to the 6 Reference Screenshots & Approved Stage 3 Mock UI:
 * - Screen 1: MAIN_MENU (Clean Header — NO fake Gold/Diamond/Clover/Lv/sessionStorage clutter)
 * - Screen 2: LOADOUT (P1..P4 Switcher, Pedestal, 5 Stat Bars +0..+5, Stacked Skill Rates (÷3)×1.6, 3-Treasure Inventory with Main Conflict Guard)
 * - Screen 3: LOBBY (4P Free-For-All vs 2v2 Team Match Alpha/Bravo, 4 Vertical Player Cards, Pass-and-Play / AI Bot Toggle)
 * - Screen 4: IN_GAME Overlay (4-Corner HUD Cards, Curved Rainbow Gauge Arc 2..12 with DC-scaled Needle, ROLL + ODD/EVEN Capsules, Skill Cut-In Banner)
 * - Screen 5: PLAYER INFO & SKILL INSPECTOR Modal (3-Column Inspector: Assets & Monopoly Progress, Core Stats & Stacked Skills, 3 Treasures)
 * - Screen 6: CITY PURCHASE & CONSTRUCTION Modal (Lap 1 Hotel Lock, Landmark Upgrade, Discount & Resulting Toll)
 * - Plus Modals: Hostile Takeover, Coin Flip Minigame (S09 Coin Master), Board Target Picker Banner, Debt / Bank Loan / Sell City, Rules & Odds, Victory Summary
 */

